 a broken jaykit in the medicine den, leafpool smearing a poluce on him mouthing \"that you left\"\n2: show hollykit leaving the medicine den, tears streaking down her eyes as she mouthes \"our minds are troubled by the emptyness\"\n3: show lionkit bounding to hollykit, looking sad, lionkit is mouthing \"distroy the middle\"\n4: show hollykit walking in the forest, each tree she passes, she ages (from kit to med app, to warrior app, to warrior)\n5: show her glancing at jayfeather, whom is sorting herbs outside the medicine den, and then lionblaze whom is hanging out with cinderheart. holly mouthes \"youre the lucky ones\"\n6: show her glancing at squif, going to her, to help her patch a bush.\n7: show hollyleaf leaving the camp, and hunting a mouse, looking depressed, as a flash of lightning, strikes, end on a white screen\n8: show her bounding unto camp, getting jayfeather and lionblaze\n9: show hollyleaf leading jayfeather out of camp, and lionblaze leading the way (fire is all around them\n10: show them running through the ashes of a fire, as they pass some burning trees, get closer up to hollyleafs face, show her looking scared\n11: show them stopping aruptly, as the cliff infront of them drops, have a small clearing, and show jayfeather looking confused\n12: show squiff finding the three, and trying to push down a log, she manages to push it down...\n13: ... ashfur steps into the scene, and gives squif an evil glare, and the two mouth the\nwords, up untill *reveal the truth, on witch you turn to hollyleaf, and show a tear falling down her face*\n14: show ashfur leaving, an evil smirk still on his face\n15: show hollyleaf screeching at squif, tears falling down her face, as she yells \"your the lucky one\" and squif looking ashamed, jayfeather looking like he got hit by a monster (figuretivly) and lionblaze just staring at squif in disbelef\n16: show hollyleaf closing her eyes and a tear dripping down her cheek\n17: transition to hollyleaf opening her eyes, runn